{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "digi101",
 "version": "0.23",
 "title": "DH-101",
 "description": "DH-101, a machine in the FUNC+SRC list after the SH-101 (clean-room). SRC page: RANGE 16'/8'/4'/2' (B), a mixer of SAW (C), PULSE (E), SUB (H: -1 oct square, -2 oct square or -2 oct 25% pulse, level within each zone) and NOISE (D), PULSE WIDTH (F) set by hand or swept by its own LFO or envelope (G: MAN / LFO rate / ENV decay). SRC pressed again: the DH-101 page: A PORT (portamento, per track, saved with the pattern) and the 101's filter, a 4-pole ladder before the track's own FLTR: B FREQ, C RESO (self-oscillates at the top), D ENV (follows the AMP envelope), E MOD (LFO), F KYB, G VIB (LFO to pitch), H RATE (the LFO); saved in the sound (slots 46 and 47). On a DH-101 track the LFO page's destinations are TUNE, SAW, NOISE, PULSE, PWM Source (the PWM knob within MAN and LFO), SUB, then Filter Freq and Filter Reso (OS 1.54). TRK + a trig shows DH-101 (OS 1.54). Needs Digi Mono 0.24 or later, which renders its voices, and machine-pages, which draws its SRC and LFO pages (core 3.0).",
 "category": "Sound",
 "author": "Robbie",
 "license": "MIT",
 "target": {
  "device": "digitakt-mk1",
  "product": "Digitakt mk1",
  "os": "1.53",
  "syx_sha256": "9bdd44bb6102fb25c143cfab97bc92b7a89c463f795d3112dce89771e29bcc92",
  "section3_sha256": "4b47a9507758ca5669ca02ab2c0374d2c04c98aece445408295cc1dcb265c5df",
